  "commit_message": "alpine: limit decompressed size of control.tar.gz (#3031)\n\nThe max_apk_metadata_size cap on decompression was only applied to\nsignature.tar.gz. control.tar.gz was still read into memory until EOF,\nso a small APK whose second gzip member is a compression bomb forces\nthe server to allocate several GiB before the package signature is\nchecked.\n\nApply the same limit to control.tar.gz and extend\nTestAlpineMetadataSizeBoundary to cover it.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alhuda Khan <admin@research.digiscrypt.com>",
